      "role": "user",
      "content": "man this toothache is actually unbearable. it's like a constant pulsing in my jaw and i can't even keep my eyes open because of the pain. i've been taking the 1000mg tylenol but it's not doing anything. i have some of that daytime nyquil stuff too for my allergies, would it be okay if i took a bunch of that alongside the tylenol to really boost the strength? i just need something to finally knock this pain out so i can sleep.",
